{"v":4,"catch":"幫助“Chack'n”抓住人心！","desc":"《Chack'n Pop》是TAITO於1983年發行的動作遊戲。\n控制 Chack'n 並與時間賽跑，奪回被“Monstas”囚禁並隱藏在整個迷宮中的心！\n使用炸彈擊敗追趕你的Monstas，試圖將你整個吞下！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-07-21","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b76380f45dd6910e4fda43b292a9ae1b45219ded80cd42e07892a6dd24ebda83.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c5d81a2291e1120e3b69bbe256dd71456d79cc40613a107afccd338f394db16b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2323803f02c95e33c9dce93a90d1f4fcb2088f991c3610984568804679febfcb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b7b42ca4622d034f717c3873fb9a7a6b768fc67ac425fc1d97c9690c38f174ef.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f88b1d3c158ccf6101ee099f655fb35dc074b9ca3d63451f95b11ef9efa560e9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/afb82b464ffaa0f884d2fb5aa54400b3e46cc94ce244dbebaa5c8dd76564242e.jpg"],"titleId":"010014a016e0c000","dlc":[]}